{"text": "Mientras caminaba, Caperucita encontró a un lobo. Él preguntó adónde iba. La niña contó que visitaría la casa de su abuela, junto al gran roble. No sabía que aquel desconocido quería engañarla. Lobo: Seguro que a tu abuela le gustan las flores.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.611208, "from": 0, "to": 8}, {"start": 0.625958, "end": 1.320083, "from": 9, "to": 17}, {"start": 1.615458, "end": 2.324333, "from": 19, "to": 29}, {"start": 2.339125, "end": 2.915083, "from": 30, "to": 38}, {"start": 2.929833, "end": 2.9741239, "from": 39, "to": 40}, {"start": 2.988916, "end": 3.180916, "from": 41, "to": 43}, {"start": 3.195666, "end": 3.638707, "from": 44, "to": 48}, {"start": 4.666833, "end": 4.903124, "from": 50, "to": 52}, {"start": 4.917875, "end": 5.523375, "from": 53, "to": 61}, {"start": 5.538166, "end": 5.966457, "from": 62, "to": 68}, {"start": 5.981208, "end": 6.453791, "from": 69, "to": 72}, {"start": 7.472833, "end": 7.679583, "from": 74, "to": 76}, {"start": 7.694333, "end": 8.048791, "from": 77, "to": 81}, {"start": 8.063583, "end": 8.491874, "from": 82, "to": 87}, {"start": 8.506625, "end": 8.639541, "from": 88, "to": 91}, {"start": 8.654291, "end": 9.348416, "from": 92, "to": 101}, {"start": 9.363166, "end": 9.496082, "from": 102, "to": 104}, {"start": 9.510875, "end": 9.865333, "from": 105, "to": 109}, {"start": 9.880083, "end": 10.012999, "from": 110, "to": 112}, {"start": 10.02775, "end": 10.145916, "from": 113, "to": 115}, {"start": 10.160666, "end": 10.618499, "from": 116, "to": 122}, {"start": 10.913875, "end": 11.238791, "from": 124, "to": 129}, {"start": 11.253541, "end": 11.356916, "from": 130, "to": 132}, {"start": 11.371708, "end": 11.667083, "from": 133, "to": 137}, {"start": 11.681833, "end": 12.139666, "from": 138, "to": 143}, {"start": 13.158666, "end": 13.365416, "from": 145, "to": 147}, {"start": 13.380208, "end": 13.808499, "from": 148, "to": 153}, {"start": 13.82325, "end": 13.956166, "from": 154, "to": 157}, {"start": 13.